# Dark popover (canonical)

Small **dark** panels appended to `body` (audit pill, timesheet day projects, similar hover copy).

- **PrimeNG:** `p-popover` + `appendTo="body"` + `appCenterPopoverCaret` (via `AppPopoverModule`).
- **`styleClass`:** `ubo-dark-popover` only — not `ubo-attribution-popover`, not `network-flag-help-popover`.
- **Styles:** `admin/src/assets/layout/_app.scss` (`.ubo-dark-popover`, content padding, arrow/`p-popover-flipped`, optional `.field-help-title` / `.field-help-text`).

Do not add a second dark popover stylesheet or one-off `styleClass` for the same look.
